{"id":"b1s-005","lang":"ja","category":"否定","phenomenon":"述語の否定を落とさない","difficulty":2,"sentence":"田中さんは会議に出席しなかった。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"出席する","roles":{"agent":"田中さん","goal":"会議"},"polarity":"-","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"polarity":"+"}]},"rationale":"出席しなかったので極性は否定。"}
{"id":"b1s-006","lang":"ja","category":"量化とスコープ","phenomenon":"全員が〜わけではない（部分否定）","difficulty":3,"input":"全員が反対したわけではない。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"反対する","roles":{"agent":"全員"},"polarity":"-","tense":"past","modality":null,"quantifiers":{"agent":"すべて"}}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"polarity":"+"}]},"rationale":"全員が反対したのではない、という否定が全称の外にかかる部分否定。"}
{"id":"b1s-007","lang":"ja","category":"比較","phenomenon":"AはBよりC を属性文に崩さない","difficulty":3,"input":"この橋は旧橋より二メートル長い。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"長い","roles":{"entity":"この橋","source":"旧橋","value":"二メートル"},"polarity":"+","tense":"present","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"attribute","value":"長い"},{"role":"agent","value":"旧橋"}]},"rationale":"比較の基準は旧橋で、差は二メートル。単なる属性文ではない。"}
{"id":"b1s-008","lang":"ja","category":"受身・使役・授受","phenomenon":"受身の動作主","difficulty":2,"input":"鈴木さんは上司に叱られた。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"叱る","roles":{"agent":"上司","patient":"鈴木さん"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"agent","value":"鈴木さん"}]},"rationale":"叱ったのは上司で、叱られたのは鈴木さん。"}
{"id":"b1s-009","lang":"ja","category":"受身・使役・授受","phenomenon":"使役の役割","difficulty":3,"input":"母が弟に野菜を食べさせた。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"食べさせる","roles":{"agent":"母","recipient":"弟","patient":"野菜"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"agent","value":"弟"},{"role":"patient","value":"弟"}]},"rationale":"させたのは母、食べる側は弟。"}
{"id":"b1s-010","lang":"ja","category":"因果・逆接・条件","phenomenon":"ので の因果","difficulty":3,"input":"雨が降ったので、試合は中止になった。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"降る","roles":{"agent":"雨"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"中止になる","roles":{"agent":"試合"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[{"type":"cause","from":0,"to":1}],"must_not":[{"relation":"contrast"},{"relation":"concession"}]},"rationale":"雨が原因で中止という因果。逆接ではない。"}
