{"id":"b1s-015","lang":"ja","category":"テ形連鎖","phenomenon":"三つの動作の時間順序","difficulty":3,"input":"彼は手を洗って、席に着いて、食事を始めた。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"洗う","roles":{"agent":"彼","patient":"手"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"着く","roles":{"agent":"彼","goal":"席"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"始める","roles":{"agent":"彼","patient":"食事"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[{"type":"sequence","from":0,"to":1},{"type":"sequence","from":1,"to":2}],"must_not":[{"relation":"cause"}]},"rationale":"テ形で結ばれた時間順の三動作。因果ではない。"}
{"id":"b1s-016","lang":"en","category":"基本の格","phenomenon":"二重目的語の受け手","difficulty":1,"input":"The teacher gave the students a new map.","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"give","roles":{"agent":"the teacher","recipient":"the students","patient":"a new map"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"recipient","value":"a new map"}]},"rationale":"渡された物は地図、受け手は生徒。"}
{"id":"b1s-017","lang":"en","category":"否定","phenomenon":"助動詞 did not の否定","difficulty":2,"input":"Maya did not open the window.","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"open","roles":{"agent":"Maya","patient":"the window"},"polarity":"-","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"polarity":"+"}]},"rationale":"did not で否定。"}
{"id":"b1s-018","lang":"en","category":"量化とスコープ","phenomenon":"Not every の否定スコープ","difficulty":3,"input":"Not every student passed the exam.","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"pass","roles":{"agent":"student","patient":"the exam"},"polarity":"-","tense":"past","modality":null,"quantifiers":{"agent":"every"}}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"polarity":"+"}]},"rationale":"全員が合格したわけではない、という部分否定。"}
{"id":"b1s-019","lang":"en","category":"連体修飾","phenomenon":"関係節の動作主","difficulty":3,"input":"The engineer who fixed the pump left early.","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"fix","roles":{"agent":"the engineer","patient":"the pump"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"leave","roles":{"agent":"the engineer"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"agent","value":"the pump"}]},"rationale":"直したのも去ったのも技師。ポンプは直された物。"}
{"id":"b1s-020","lang":"en","category":"因果・逆接・条件","phenomenon":"受身と because の因果","difficulty":3,"input":"The bridge was closed because a storm damaged the pier.","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"close","roles":{"patient":"the bridge"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"damage","roles":{"agent":"a storm","patient":"the pier"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[{"type":"cause","from":1,"to":0}],"must_not":[{"role":"agent","value":"the bridge"}]},"rationale":"橋が閉鎖されたのは嵐が橋脚を損傷したから。原因は後ろの節。"}
