{"id":"b1s-023","lang":"ja","category":"因果・逆接・条件","phenomenon":"たら の条件","difficulty":2,"input":"鍵を忘れたら、先に帰ってください。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"忘れる","roles":{"patient":"鍵"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null},{"predicate":"帰る","roles":{},"polarity":"+","tense":"present","modality":"request"}],"relations":[{"type":"condition","from":0,"to":1}],"must_not":[{"relation":"cause"},{"relation":"concession"}]},"rationale":"鍵を忘れた場合という条件で、帰るよう依頼する。"}
{"id":"b1s-024","lang":"ja","category":"受身・使役・授受","phenomenon":"もらう の授受方向","difficulty":1,"input":"弟は友だちに本をもらった。","expect":{"readable":true,"clauses":[{"predicate":"もらう","roles":{"agent":"弟","source":"友だち","patient":"本"},"polarity":"+","tense":"past","modality":null}],"relations":[],"must_not":[{"role":"recipient","value":"友だち"},{"role":"agent","value":"友だち"}]},"rationale":"受け取ったのは弟、渡したのは友だち。"}
